      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Concept:</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">We would use the concept of BODMAS-</p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https:https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/12/619c84099b892b6172520023_16389656398191.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Calculation:</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;60&nbsp;&divide; 16&nbsp;&times; 2 - [76&nbsp;&divide; 5 of 19 - 15&nbsp;&divide; 8&nbsp;&times; (21 - 25) - 3]&nbsp;&divide; 53</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;<span style=\"\">&nbsp;60&nbsp;&divide; 16&nbsp;&times; 2 - [76&nbsp;&divide; 5 of 19 - 15&nbsp;&divide; 8&nbsp;&times; -4&nbsp;- 3]&nbsp;&divide; 53</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;<span style=\"\">60&nbsp;&divide; 16&nbsp;&times; 2 - [76&nbsp;&divide; 95&nbsp;- 15&nbsp;&divide; 8&nbsp;&times; -4</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;- 3]&nbsp;&divide; 53</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr; <span style=\"\">60&nbsp;&divide; 16&nbsp;&times; 2 - [<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(4\\over5\\)</span> - <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(15\\over8\\)</span>&nbsp;&times; -4&nbsp;- 3]&nbsp;&divide; 53</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;<span style=\"\">60&nbsp;&divide; 16&nbsp;&times; 2 - [</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(4\\over5\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(15\\over2\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;3]&nbsp;&divide; 53</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">60&nbsp;&divide; 16&nbsp;&times; 2 - [</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(83\\over10\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;3]&nbsp;&divide; 53</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">60&nbsp;&divide; 16&nbsp;&times; 2 - [</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(83-30\\over10\\)</span><span style=\"\">]&nbsp;&divide; 53</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">60&nbsp;&divide; 16&nbsp;&times; 2 - [</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(53\\over10\\)</span><span style=\"\">]&nbsp;&divide; 53</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(15\\over4\\)</span>&nbsp;&times; 2 -&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(1\\over10\\)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(15\\over2\\)</span>&nbsp;-&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(1\\over10\\)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(74\\over10\\)</span>&nbsp;=&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(7\\frac{2}{{5}}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&there4; The answer is<strong> <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(7\\frac{2}{{5}}\\)</span>.</strong></span></p>\n",
