      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&nbsp;&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{4}{5}\\)</span>&nbsp;&divide;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(3\\frac{1}{4}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;of&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{8}{{13}}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{\\frac{1}{7} - \\frac{1}{8}}{\\frac{1}{7} + \\frac{1}{8}}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;&times;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(4\\frac{2}{7}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{3}{5}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Concept used:&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n<p>Follow the BODMAS rule according to the table given below</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage31066.png\" style=\"width: 345px; height: 190px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&nbsp;&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{4}{5}\\)</span>&nbsp;&divide;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(3\\frac{1}{4}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;of&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{8}{{13}}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{\\frac{1}{7} - \\frac{1}{8}}{\\frac{1}{7} + \\frac{1}{8}}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;&times;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(4\\frac{2}{7}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{3}{5}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&nbsp;&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{4}{5}\\)</span>&nbsp;&divide;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{13}{4}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;of&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{8}{{13}}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{\\frac{1}{7} - \\frac{1}{8}}{\\frac{1}{7} + \\frac{1}{8}}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;&times;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{30}{7}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{3}{5}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&nbsp;&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{4}{5}\\)</span>&nbsp;&divide;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{13}{4}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;&times;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{8}{{13}}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{\\frac{1}{7} - \\frac{1}{8}}{\\frac{1}{7} + \\frac{1}{8}}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;&times;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{30}{7}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{3}{5}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&nbsp;&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{4}{5}\\)</span>&nbsp;&divide;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{2}{1}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{\\frac{1}{7} - \\frac{1}{8}}{\\frac{1}{7} + \\frac{1}{8}}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;&times;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{30}{7}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{3}{5}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&nbsp;&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{4}{5}\\)</span>&nbsp;&times;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{2}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{15}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;&times;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{30}{7}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{3}{5}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&nbsp;&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{2}{5}\\)</span>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">-&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{2}{7}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{3}{5}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&nbsp;&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\"